Test Setup for 256QAM
    [Documentation]    Configuration files are saved at test level
    Backup Files        listFileDesc=${FD_ALL}


Test Teardown for 256QAM
    [Documentation]    Perform needed actions at the end of a test case
    Dated log                       Test teardown : start
    Restore Files                   listFileDesc=${FD_ALL}

    # Stop Sherpa if needed
    Run Keyword If                  ${enable_sherpa} == ${True}             Sherpa.Deactivate Sherpa and Stop Collect
    # "Test Teardown" KW from Setup.robot
    Test Teardown
    Dated log                       Test teardown : end

Set 256QAM Config
    [Documentation]                 Set suitable configuration for 256QAM tests (SCF and swconfig.txt)
    # Updated SCF
    &{scf_256qam}       Create Dictionary   dist_name=MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}/NRBTS-${NRBTS_ID}/NRCELL-${NRCELL_ID}
    ...                                     parameter=actDl256Qam
    ...                                     value=true

	&{scf_adddmrsdl}    Create Dictionary   dist_name=MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}/NRBTS-${NRBTS_ID}/NRCELL-${NRCELL_ID}
    ...                                     parameter=dlDMRSAdditionalPosition
    ...                                     value=No additional DMRS

    &{scf_adddmrsul}    Create Dictionary   dist_name=MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}/NRBTS-${NRBTS_ID}/NRCELL-${NRCELL_ID}
    ...                                     parameter=ulDMRSAdditionalPosition
    ...                                     value=No additional DMRS

